     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Writing about the past",
     "texto": [
      "In a personal message, greet the person, say where you went and tell one or two activities. End with a question for the other person.",
      "**Πέρασα πολύ ωραία** means «I had a really good time». **Επισκέφτηκα** means I visited; **γνώρισα** means I met. Use connectors like **επίσης** (also) and **αλλά** (but)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
